01:06:47,003 --> 01:06:49,505
<font color="white"><i>A vehicle-to-vehicle collision resulting</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>in a fall has been reported.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

1391
01:06:49,588 --> 01:06:51,799
<font color="white"><i>At San 58, Jucheon-ro, Seobu-gu, Gangwon.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

1392
01:06:51,882 --> 01:06:54,385
