<font color="white">the scene. We have identified the vehicle.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1394
01:06:58,305 --> 01:07:00,808
<font color="white">Plate number 8340… 834…</font><font color="white"></font>

1395
01:07:02,727 --> 01:07:04,478
<font color="white">It's that damn Benz from earlier!</font><font color="white"></font>

1396
01:07:10,985 --> 01:07:13,279
<font color="white">-[siren wailing]</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[gasps]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1397
01:07:14,405 --> 01:07:15,865
<font color="white">The police are on our tail.</font><font color="white"></font>

1398
01:07:18,534 --> 01:07:19,827
<font color="white">[all gasp]</font><font color="white"></font>

1399
01:07:26,250 --> 01:07:27,251
<font color="white">Everybody get down now!</font><font color="white"></font>

1400
01:07:27,334 --> 01:07:28,377
<font color="white">-[gasps]</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Oh!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1401
01:07:28,461 --> 01:07:30,004
<font color="white">[siren continues]</font><font color="white"></font>

1402
01:07:42,099 --> 01:07:43,100
<font color="white">Wait, what the hell?</font><font color="white"></font>

1403
01:07:47,772 --> 01:07:49,356
<font color="white">This guy is nuts.</font><font color="white"></font>

1404
01:07:52,443 --> 01:07:53,694
<font color="white">[breathing shakily]</font><font color="white"></font>

1405
01:07:53,778 --> 01:07:54,862
<font color="white">Hey, what are you doing?</font><font color="white"></font>

1406
01:07:54,945 --> 01:07:55,946
<font color="white">You need to drive!</font><font color="white"></font>

1407
01:07:58,157 --> 01:07:59,241
<font color="white">[Sang-gu] Is this a Tesla?</font><font color="white"></font>

1408
01:08:03,954 --> 01:08:06,373
<font color="white">Hey, you need to pull over. You hear?</font><font color="white"></font>

1409
01:08:07,833 --> 01:08:09,085
<font color="white">Hm.</font><font color="white"></font>

1410
01:08:09,168 --> 01:08:11,087
<font color="white">I said, pull over.</font><font color="white"></font>

1411
01:08:30,648 --> 01:08:31,649
<font color="white">[grunts]</font><font color="white"></font>

1412
01:08:35,194 --> 01:08:37,154
<font color="white">Ah…</font><font color="white"></font>

1413
01:08:37,238 --> 01:08:38,489
<font color="white">Are you out of your mind?</font><font color="white"></font>

1414
01:08:44,370 --> 01:08:45,913
<font color="white">Who are you people, huh?</font><font color="white"></font>

1415
01:08:46,539 --> 01:08:48,415
<font color="white">[Hyun-woo inhales deeply]</font><font color="white"></font>

1416
01:08:48,499 --> 01:08:49,500
<font color="white">[Sang-gu] Uh…</font><font color="white"></font>

1417
01:08:50,126 --> 01:08:52,086
<font color="white">[sighs, chuckles]</font><font color="white"></font>

1418
01:08:55,464 --> 01:08:56,966
<font color="white">[Sang-gu] Did you find it?</font><font color="white"></font>

1419
01:08:57,049 --> 01:08:58,217
<font color="white">[chuckles]</font><font color="white"></font>

1420
01:08:58,300 --> 01:08:59,802
<font color="white">[chuckles]</font><font color="white"></font>

1421
01:09:01,554 --> 01:09:03,180
<font color="white">You're the ones from earlier.</font><font color="white"></font>

1422
01:09:03,848 --> 01:09:05,391
<font color="white">Oh, hi, how are you?</font><font color="white"></font>

1423
01:09:05,474 --> 01:09:06,475
<font color="white">-Hello.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[Do-mi chuckles]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1424
01:09:06,559 --> 01:09:09,311
<font color="white">Oh, we're late for a gig,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so we really need to get going.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1425
01:09:09,395 --> 01:09:10,729
<font color="white">-[chuckles]</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-We're singers, actually.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1426
01:09:11,897 --> 01:09:13,065
<font color="white">[chuckles]</font><font color="white"></font>

1427
01:09:13,149 --> 01:09:14,942
<font color="white">Don't you recognize me?</font><font color="white"></font>

1428
01:09:15,025 --> 01:09:17,027
<font color="white">Endless Charm Byeon Do-mi.</font><font color="white"></font>

1429
01:09:17,111 --> 01:09:18,612
<font color="white">-Sound familiar? [chuckles]</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Peace.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1430
01:09:19,321 --> 01:09:20,447
<font color="white">Uh-huh….</font><font color="white"></font>

1431
01:09:20,531 --> 01:09:21,532
<font color="white">Uh-huh.</font><font color="white"></font>

1432
01:09:22,032 --> 01:09:23,617
<font color="white">Are you a singer too?</font><font color="white"></font>

1433
01:09:25,786 --> 01:09:26,954
<font color="white">You caught me.</font><font color="white"></font>

1434
01:09:28,330 --> 01:09:30,332
<font color="white">Love you. [chuckles]</font><font color="white"></font>

1435
01:09:35,337 --> 01:09:36,338
<font color="white">[gulps]</font><font color="white"></font>

1436
01:09:37,923 --> 01:09:39,258
<font color="white">[Seong-gon] Hm?</font><font color="white"></font>

1437
01:09:44,138 --> 01:09:46,265
<font color="white">[breathing shakily]</font><font color="white"></font>

1438
01:09:52,646 --> 01:09:54,064
<font color="white">[officer] What is that?</font><font color="white"></font>

1439
01:09:55,316 --> 01:09:56,317
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

1440
01:09:57,568 --> 01:09:58,694
<font color="white">[both chuckle]</font><font color="white"></font>

1441
01:09:59,612 --> 01:10:01,071
<font color="white">And what is that thing?</font><font color="white"></font>

1442
01:10:01,155 --> 01:10:03,115
<font color="white">[stammers] This is just a gun</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that was here.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1443
01:10:03,199 --> 01:10:04,200
<font color="white">-[officer] Freeze!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[yelps]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1444
01:10:04,283 --> 01:10:06,452
<font color="white">-[stammering] What's wrong?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[Do-mi screams]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1445
01:10:06,535 --> 01:10:08,037
<font color="white">Put down the gun and show your hands!</font><font color="white"></font>

1446
01:10:08,120 --> 01:10:10,581
<font color="white">-[screaming]</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Put the gun down, and… hands, hands!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1447
01:10:10,664 --> 01:10:12,082
<font color="white">-I'm sorry.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-The gun, the gun.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1448
01:10:12,166 --> 01:10:14,001
<font color="white">-This man's the owner. It's his, it's his.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yeah, it's my gun, sir.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1449
01:10:14,084 --> 01:10:15,169
<font color="white">Yeah, yeah, I'm a hunter.</font><font color="white"></font>

1450
01:10:16,629 --> 01:10:18,672
<font color="white">-You said "singer."</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Currently, I'm a hunter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1451
01:10:20,966 --> 01:10:23,886
<font color="white">-Get those clothes out of the way.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Okay. Okay, I'll move them. Okay.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1452
01:10:23,969 --> 01:10:25,512
<font color="white">-[gasps] No, no, no, no.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-But-- But--</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1453
01:10:26,889 --> 01:10:28,140
<font color="white">What the hell?</font><font color="white"></font>

1454
01:10:28,224 --> 01:10:29,350
<font color="white">-You people murdered that guy?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[Do-mi] No!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1455
01:10:29,433 --> 01:10:31,685
<font color="white">No, no, he's not dead,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he's just pretending.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1456
01:10:31,769 --> 01:10:32,895
<font color="white">He's actually okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

1457
01:10:32,978 --> 01:10:34,313
<font color="white">[all screaming, gasping]</font><font color="white"></font>

1458
01:10:34,396 --> 01:10:36,106
<font color="white">[officer]</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Take your hands off the wheel and get out.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1459
01:10:36,190 --> 01:10:37,608
<font color="white">-The next shot is a live round!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Okay, we'll get out.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1460
01:10:37,691 --> 01:10:38,817
<font color="white">We'll get out, we'll get out.</font><font color="white"></font>

1461
01:10:38,901 --> 01:10:41,737
<font color="white">-We just need to get to our gig.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[officer] You're not going to any gig.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1462
01:10:41,820 --> 01:10:43,822
<font color="white">-We're bringing you in.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Bringing us in?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1463
01:10:45,658 --> 01:10:47,076
<font color="white">I'm not going through that again!</font><font color="white"></font>

1464
01:10:48,160 --> 01:10:50,037
<font color="white">-[Do-mi screams]</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[officer] Whoa! Whoa! Hey, you!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1465
01:10:51,622 --> 01:10:52,581
<font color="white">[grunting]</font><font color="white"></font>

1466
01:10:52,665 --> 01:10:54,041
<font color="white">Get 'em! Get 'em!</font><font color="white"></font>

1467
01:10:54,124 --> 01:10:55,501
<font color="white">What do you think you're doing, man?</font><font color="white"></font>

1468
01:10:55,584 --> 01:10:59,255
<font color="white">The last time they took me in,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I lost 20 years of my life. [sighs]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1469
01:10:59,338 --> 01:11:01,048
<font color="white">I'm not letting it happen again.</font><font color="white"></font>

1470
01:11:01,131 --> 01:11:02,591
<font color="white">Think about what you're doing.</font><font color="white"></font>

1471
01:11:02,675 --> 01:11:04,051
<font color="white">We won't be able to do the show now.</font><font color="white"></font>

1472
01:11:04,134 --> 01:11:05,844
<font color="white">Hey, forget about the show.</font><font color="white"></font>

1473
01:11:05,928 --> 01:11:06,971
<font color="white">-We're in trouble here.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[phone buzzes]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1474
01:11:07,054 --> 01:11:08,472
<font color="white">Shut up!</font><font color="white"></font>

1475
01:11:09,765 --> 01:11:12,977
<font color="white">-Hello, we're almost there. We're in… um…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[sighs]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1476
01:11:13,811 --> 01:11:14,895
<font color="white">…downtown Gangwon.</font><font color="white"></font>

1477
01:11:14,979 --> 01:11:16,563
<font color="white">[Do-mi] Hey, are you okay?</font><font color="white"></font>

1478
01:11:16,647 --> 01:11:18,065
<font color="white">[sighs] That's not the point.</font><font color="white"></font>

1479
01:11:18,148 --> 01:11:19,692
<font color="white">Hurry up,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Mr. Gong is really mad right now.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1480
01:11:19,775 --> 01:11:21,694
<font color="white">-Uh-huh. Oh, is that right?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[Do-mi] Wake up! Damn it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1481
01:11:22,278 --> 01:11:24,571
<font color="white">Hey, Gu Sang-gu! Snap out of it!</font><font color="white"></font>

1482
01:11:24,655 --> 01:11:26,240
<font color="white">[Miss Yang] </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Come on,</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>this is being aired live.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

1483
01:11:26,323 --> 01:11:28,075
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>You can't be late like this.</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[sighs]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1484
01:11:28,158 --> 01:11:31,578
<font color="white">[groans] He'll replace you with the backup</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">group if you're late to rehearsal.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1485
01:11:32,288 --> 01:11:33,998
<font color="white">I see. Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

1486
01:11:34,081 --> 01:11:35,916
<font color="white">Tell them not to bother showing up here.</font><font color="white"></font>

1487
01:11:36,000 --> 01:11:38,377
<font color="white">Hey, hey. Hey, don't even think</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">about showing up here, damn it!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1488
01:11:38,460 --> 01:11:39,920
<font color="white">[Miss Yang] </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Just get here! Hurry, hurry!</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

1489
01:11:40,546 --> 01:11:42,047
<font color="white">We're gonna get there on time.</font><font color="white"></font>

1490
01:11:42,715 --> 01:11:44,466
<font color="white">-Consider that a promise.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[Ji-tae] </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>Don't come!</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

1491
01:11:44,550 --> 01:11:46,135
<font color="white">-</font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>Don't come!</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[Miss Yang] </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>Just hurry up!</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

1492
01:11:47,303 --> 01:11:49,013
<font color="white">-Step on it.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[growls]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1493
01:11:49,722 --> 01:11:51,598
<font color="white">Hey, can we just give up</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and go home already?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1494
01:11:51,682 --> 01:11:53,100
<font color="white">I said step on it, now!</font><font color="white"></font>

1495
01:11:53,183 --> 01:11:56,020
<font color="white">Let's go!</font><font color="white"></font>

1496
01:12:01,734 --> 01:12:03,736
<font color="white">[siren wailing]</font><font color="white"></font>

1497
01:12:04,695 --> 01:12:06,780
<font color="white">Oh! Shit, there they are.</font><font color="white"></font>

1498
01:12:10,743 --> 01:12:12,202
<font color="white">Are you using live rounds?</font><font color="white"></font>

1499
01:12:12,286 --> 01:12:13,912
<font color="white">I told you, I saw a dead body.</font><font color="white"></font>

1500
01:12:14,580 --> 01:12:16,415
<font color="white">Those guys are real murderers.</font><font color="white"></font>

1501
01:12:16,498 --> 01:12:19,501
<font color="white">Wee-oo, wee-oo. Look, the police</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">are coming, stop! Better pull over.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1502
01:12:19,585 --> 01:12:22,671
<font color="white">No way, we don't have time.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">We're supposed to be there already.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1503
01:12:22,755 --> 01:12:24,882
<font color="white">Come on, we have</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to catch these guys. Move closer!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1504
01:12:30,054 --> 01:12:31,513
<font color="white">[screams]</font><font color="white"></font>

1505
01:12:31,597 --> 01:12:32,973
<font color="white">That son of bitch is shooting at us!</font><font color="white"></font>

1506
01:12:37,102 --> 01:12:38,771
<font color="white">[Do-mi screaming]</font><font color="white"></font>

1507
01:12:38,854 --> 01:12:39,855
<font color="white">Oh, shit.</font><font color="white"></font>

1508
01:12:42,316 --> 01:12:43,817
<font color="white">[Do-mi crying]</font><font color="white"></font>

1509
01:12:44,526 --> 01:12:46,236
<font color="white">-[yelping]</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[officer] Stop the car!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1510
01:12:49,156 --> 01:12:50,699
<font color="white">Stop the car!</font><font color="white"></font>

1511
01:12:50,783 --> 01:12:52,034
<font color="white">[horn blaring]</font><font color="white"></font>

1512
01:12:52,117 --> 01:12:54,536
<font color="white">-Whoa! Watch out!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-[officers exclaim]</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1513
01:12:54,620 --> 01:12:55,871
<font color="white">[screaming]</font><font color="white"></font>

1514
01:12:57,956 --> 01:12:59,875
<font color="white">[screaming]</font><font color="white"></font>

1515
01:12:59,958 --> 01:13:02,127
<font color="white">They could've killed us.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">What's their problem, anyway?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1516
01:13:02,211 --> 01:13:04,004
<font color="white">You're their problem, you idiot!</font><font color="white"></font>

1517
01:13:04,088 --> 01:13:05,881
<font color="white">Yeah, but we didn't do anything wrong.</font><font color="white"></font>

1518
01:13:05,964 --> 01:13:08,133
<font color="white">It's their fault</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for shooting at us willy nilly.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1519
01:13:08,217 --> 01:13:10,010
<font color="white">They're gonna let us perform, aren't they?</font><font color="white"></font>

1520
01:13:10,094 --> 01:13:13,430
<font color="white">There's this new rap I wrote, and I told</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">my mother I'd be doing it at the concert.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1521
01:13:13,514 --> 01:13:14,807
<font color="white">[Do-mi] Why would you write a new rap?</font><font color="white"></font>

1522
01:13:14,890 --> 01:13:16,433
<font color="white">'Cause I'll be rapping during the intro,</font><font color="white"></font>

1523
01:13:16,517 --> 01:13:17,893
<font color="white">the outro</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and the interlude, didn't you know?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1524
01:13:17,976 --> 01:13:19,645
<font color="white">Shut up! No, you're not!</font><font color="white"></font>

1525
01:13:19,728 --> 01:13:21,438
<font color="white">Okay, look, we're doing the original song.</font><font color="white"></font>

1526
01:13:21,522 --> 01:13:23,023
<font color="white">-Yeah.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Hey, wait a minute.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1527
01:13:24,525 --> 01:13:26,443
<font color="white">Does that mean you lied to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

1528
01:13:26,527 --> 01:13:29,321
<font color="white">Let's just get there,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so we can do this concert, okay?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1529
01:13:29,405 --> 01:13:31,115
<font color="white">And next time you can rap</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as much as you want.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1530
01:13:31,198 --> 01:13:34,034
<font color="white">Next time?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">So then, you did lie to me, didn't you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1531
01:13:34,118 --> 01:13:37,037
<font color="white">Let's focus on doing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the best show that we can today, okay?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1532
01:13:37,121 --> 01:13:39,998
<font color="white">So you lied, you bastard!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">You son of a bitch,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

1533
01:13:40,082 --> 01:13:41,208
<font color="white">-you always do this to me!</font><font color="white">
